# Defense in depth for git archive; CI also rejects tracked private files.
**/private export-ignore
**/storage export-ignore
**/attachments export-ignore
artifacts export-ignore
.local-backups export-ignore
.local-build export-ignore
**/config/llm.json export-ignore
**/credentials.json export-ignore
**/secrets.json export-ignore
**/atlas-runtime.json export-ignore
.env export-ignore
.env.* export-ignore
.env.example -export-ignore
*.atlas export-ignore
*.pem export-ignore
*.key export-ignore
